<title>JAPAN: Jichodo plans share split.</title>
<headline>Jichodo plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jichodo Co Ltd said on Wednesday it planned a 1.05-for-1 share split on February 18, for shareholders as of December 31.</p>
</text>
